    "body": "> It seems that frames (`iframe`, `frame`, `embed`, `object`) are not protected as their responses are always seen as CORS-same-origin. I think it's correct they need a special case.\r\n\r\nThis is surprising, do you mean that when foo.example embeds `<iframe src=\"https://bar.example\">`, the response for that initial navigation request is seen as CORS-same-origin?",
