    "body": "Yeah, I think navigations always end up with a non-opaque response. With navigations it's also more tricky as you have the source (document with the link that navigates the target), the ancestor chain (if the target is in a frame), and the target. And you have redirects of course that should probably taint as well. Might well be the same problem/solution as that other PR.",
